# Enemy frigate: the capital ship, 26 units long on the field, and the one the
# whole sortie is about.
#
# Nine blocks, and every hardpoint sits in one you can see: the navigation
# array in the prow, the two turrets on their beam sponsons, the shield
# generator on the bridge, the life support pod slung underneath, and the
# drives in the block at the tail. Cut any of them off and both the picture
# and the ship's behaviour change, which is only true because the picture has
# somewhere for each of them to be.
#
# Seats, from k_frigate_subs in src/sim.cpp, divided by 100 and by the 26 unit
# hull length: nav (0, 0.027, 0.388), turrets (+/-0.104, 0.031, 0.139),
# shields (0, 0.077, -0.023), life support (0, -0.038, -0.127),
# engines (0, 0, -0.446).

mtllib frigate.mtl

# ---- spine: the long body everything else hangs off
usemtl hull
v  -0.075  -0.045  -0.420
v   0.075  -0.045  -0.420
v   0.075   0.045  -0.420
v  -0.075   0.045  -0.420
v  -0.062  -0.040   0.300
v   0.062  -0.040   0.300
v   0.062   0.045   0.300
v  -0.062   0.045   0.300
